---
description: >-
  Three databases inside a group all connect from the same right-to-left
  port pair (`:R --> L:`) into a single MCP server, combined with an
  explicit `align column db1 db2 db3`, verifying the three same-port
  siblings stack vertically without overlapping.
---
architecture-beta
  group api(cloud)[API]
  service db1(database)[DB1] in api
  service db2(database)[DB2] in api
  service db3(database)[DB3] in api
  service mcp(server)[MCP] in api
  db1:R --> L:mcp
  db2:R --> L:mcp
  db3:R --> L:mcp
  align column db1 db2 db3
